    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Not sure what's the best API for js templates. We already have a `messages` template so it could be better to have these there with something like:\r\n```javascript\r\nchat({\r\n  templates: {\r\n    messages: {\r\n      assistant: {\r\n        leading: 'Leading'\r\n        // rest\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n})\r\n```\r\nThis might be too much nesting tho.\r\n",
    "commit_id": "cd8becabd2a00ca7e6bc4c6b397892434389e6ca",
    "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:35:26Z",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -868,6 +957,34 @@ export type ChatTemplates<THit extends NonNullable<object> = BaseHit> =\n       regenerateLabelText?: string;\n     }>;\n \n+    /**\n+     * Templates to use for the assistant message.\n+     */\n+    assistantMessage: Partial<{\n+      /**\n+       * Template to use for the assistant message leading content.\n+       */\n+      leading: Template;\n+      /**\n+       * Template to use for the assistant message footer content.\n+       */\n+      footer: Template;\n+    }>;\n+\n+    /**\n+     * Templates to use for the user message.\n+     */\n+    userMessage: Partial<{\n+      /**\n+       * Template to use for the user message leading content.\n+       */\n+      leading: Template;\n+      /**\n+       * Template to use for the user message footer content.\n+       */\n+      footer: Template;\n+    }>;",
